  "limits": [
    "No physical timer, OS, IRQ, device, media or hardware execution; Unicorn Cortex-A15 synthetic CPU behavior is not target fidelity.",
    "20 new cases separate from prior39 UI timer and17 kernel ABI cases; neither previous result is modified.",
    "Init only accepted prefix through525b7ec4 is executed, stopping before525b7ec8 call525ce770; rejection return is executed. Later init IRQ/hardware path is static only.",
    "Configuration pointer initializer and board callback binder are static evidence; startup invocation, runtime overrides and full callback hookup are not executed.",
    "Original parser, key lookup, next token, strlen and memcmp execute without parser stubs, but tests cover selected strings only, not all malformed configurations or overflow grammar.",
    "One arithmetic periodffffffff case is an explicitly synthetic fragment input rejected by the initializer; it does not show a runtime producer.",
    "Board MMIO addresses map ordinary synthetic RAM; reads immediately reflect prior writes by fixture. IRQ helpers are stubs. No nominal milliseconds, hardware clock rate, actual elapsed duration or clock tree conclusion.",
    "Untouched angr C is explanatory only: clock_initialize contains an uninitialized index in later IRQ path, and tail-call recovery in wrapper/board initialization is not authoritative. Full ARM and executed ranges govern.",
    "Authentication, nonzero bank producers, device updates, restart and final buffer lifetime are outside scope."
  ],
